    10	Bug report reproduction is an important, but time-consuming task carried out during mobile app maintenance.
    11	To accelerate this task, current research has proposed automated reproduction techniques that rely on a guided
    12	dynamic exploration of the app to match bug report steps with UI events in a mobile app. However, these
    13	techniques struggle to find the correct match when the bug reports have missing or inaccurately described
    14	steps. To address these limitations, we propose a new bug report reproduction technique that uses an app’s UI
    15	model to perform a global search across all possible matches between steps and UI actions and identify the
